{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"id":"Snapmaker.Luban","latestVersion":"4.15.0","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"A Free, Intuitive 3-in-1 Software for Beginners","license":"AGPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/Snapmaker/Luban/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"A Free, Intuitive 3-in-1 Software for Beginners","license":"AGPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/Snapmaker/Luban/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Snapmaker Luban is open source, 3-in-1 CAM software developed by Snapmaker. It is optimized for Snapmaker machines, offering intuitive control for 3D printing, laser engraving or cutting, and CNC machining. With a user-friendly Beginner's Guide, detailed settings explanations, and a streamlined workflow, you can quickly learn and use all three functions. Download it now to embark on your DIY and craft journey!","moniker":"snapmakerluban","name":"Snapmaker Luban","packageUrl":"https://www.snapmaker.com/snapmaker-luban","publisher":"Snapmaker Software Team","publisherUrl":"https://www.snapmaker.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/Snapmaker/Luban/releases/tag/v4.15.0","tags":["3d","3d-printer","3d-printing","maker","model","slicer"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"易上手且强大的 3D 打印软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Snapmaker Luban 是由深圳快造科技有限公司独立研发的一款免费、开源的 CAM 软件，致力于提供 3D 打印、激光雕刻与切割，以及 CNC 雕刻全面操控的软件服务，使用这三种功能就如点击几个按钮一样简单。Luban 为各类喜欢 DIY、手工艺的创客提供电脑编程和电脑软件设计服务。此外，Luban 还为 Snapmaker 生产的 3D 打印机提供软件更新和维护服务。","packageUrl":"https://snapmaker.cn/snapmaker-luban","publisherUrl":"https://snapmaker.cn/","tags":["3d","3d打印","3d打印机","切片","模型"]}},"longDescription":"Snapmaker Luban is open source, 3-in-1 CAM software developed by Snapmaker. It is optimized for Snapmaker machines, offering intuitive control for 3D printing, laser engraving or cutting, and CNC machining. With a user-friendly Beginner's Guide, detailed settings explanations, and a streamlined workflow, you can quic